    },
    {
      "id": "10ef4b263b93d26d7c3696f7b622cb798ea87344f9206e7049d60be212db3556",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "54d52c197b52b2fb7b4fe0cfcc0f699688186406519ea3de0125e8115cefabe3",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ec5c7397709826a85a85611b74ab3b43e3477ed8e28d808730ab5b64eb84b03",
      "text": "Sessions, Context Windows & Turns",
      "hash": "6ba86329848f193a00922dde232ac1e483d8805be061a48f5580560ee54d0b69"
    },
    {
      "id": "661e3a973e4c185504a890b2a6141e12cd75ca8a8c798587bb9263e56d8cbaf2",
      "text": "System prompt",
      "hash": "561257c019e5e351b341fcb53a45a61e2748698f14404bd38a3dbe58a957ec30"
    },
    {
      "id": "6eaac613ce37be8bcb2c0bac042775a5fccd739739540552d1a172454acac454",
      "text": "The instructions the harness prepends to every model provider request — the agent's standing brief. Usually stable across a session.",
      "hash": "c6bc37b61f974149ed93ba4b8d5550a57d5cc059d5475332cb082bf59bf8ec4e"
    },
    {
      "id": "6648ce32e9b1799a3f613abbc80aa70d513b7a44a13b9db761aacccd0ec23c0e",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "344494ea5e44b69563c9ee4c3face980d49a903d98690c9e3a9e8dbe13633062",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4ec3550efe1860546325a4e39b229f4a9af8b789fd2413faf4eb89efa12c927",
      "text": "The instructions the",
      "hash": "2a17fb1539d7817abde7b635bb710eae43564b6aa1db29113823b5685225821d"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a622522a84fa5f899cacf32dcb31b7506bfb1b20843f4f61e297ca711634b1e",
      "text": "prepends to every",
      "hash": "9de0a4c4aadf0c514b2879ddc6bb31c1f7cf00dc4fabc6c2405dcd68beabc957"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0e7c8af2e97fe05b3b400e56e79a757a2508a5250ad39f3631e2549be7d1342",
      "text": "model provider request",
      "hash": "3004d539f1f0ae7a40070d95ba4a1323d874684827edf4d55b29a1056f8da7a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0089df2ed08ed0cd9a08afb2756dabdebc6128e705246e5e9148b5cffaf5468",
      "text": "— the",
      "hash": "4b4c2edaae377e0f86cfdaebcd2d63a27f6438259b3bb97065b79332660fe2d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e12e1a6f6620253b852b20da9cd8605eb0f0a3bef0914c517779f528b725652",
      "text": "'s standing brief: who it is, how to behave, which",
      "hash": "326a60cff733a49379dc1cd13b44f1cdc4f6ea1cb1ed571f6f19219b7ac3d812"
    },
    {
      "id": "537e00d8a4cacd15f8bc0706d65fb9506d2b7d0bb3bd08354da8551e503a4838",
      "text": "it can call, what conventions to follow. Usually stable across a",
      "hash": "70e6a28adf20caca641a67e569b4b83c7dc94d5f54159061376b20733bb0b0c4"
    },
    {
      "id": "32503ef63ed7d15f94f3d43cc160b8516501a61f5015bc79864a317539f8ee93",
      "text": "The system prompt is written by the harness vendor, not by you, and in coding harnesses it's big — often tens of thousands of",
      "hash": "6c9f043fdeaf54069ee7b546f93d0f2f2cd0fa08df2dcb8ad0d252c967410cf9"
    },
    {
      "id": "d23cedbfcd8ff1d181a02d0dd0c6186f79b35f6d8e45acf81979247600db95ed",
      "text": "of behavioural rules, tool descriptions, and edge-case handling, all paid as",
      "hash": "164de730740cb337aba7ea4f613615e9c97ae9cfaa3c8356266c650e4ca6cb5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bd8146860b7a98c3f49007d0e7befe3193d5cd05e87598b9fc62ac0e5a54d204",
      "text": "input tokens",
      "hash": "f0c1cb4cda1985a408b12908c01227b01065a8cdfc2a03e2106ca60275f27d16"
    },
    {
      "id": "9678bbd696636bd02d2abb0118e9ba4bc9ee8ba8239444178aeb41210da9b66d",
      "text": "on every",
      "hash": "9c34ac1fbff22cab4932baa69eb90745f947cf422eff5ee836621fb87edec310"
    },
    {
      "id": "9017f03124ecb0f27a473b4b21e968679ec750d6e6a479762b4ba02597de18e6",
      "text": ". Your own standing instructions ride along with it: files like",
      "hash": "9d8c94a05c2a3450b15f69e8e2a30b9806f630e551c5dcc1e3ed005a4e82b362"
    },
    {
      "id": "20c9d88e55ed711294e9de1d17028390c08971b28e89f14e96251cb7a07112a4",
      "text": "are loaded next to the system prompt at the start of the session, so the",
      "hash": "d2be1da9b6392a836454d095bdd592ba8c67e180ac9e957b98f33095c43bccaf"
    },
    {
      "id": "10afb718e9248962e1aab5ab597c29bec41898dcd037805f1f052725c77bb0ba",
      "text": "reads the vendor's brief and yours together before it ever sees your message.",
      "hash": "7999333062007eac0317aa347704e4e4b2c1377e672ebabb576dea1eb58fdd83"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8603daaeed9943c94585a9ba1486760332b58997a0a1abb5b4b4a7215bf948a",
      "text": "Because it's identical on every request, it forms the start of the",
      "hash": "138ed60b579d7102084d0a97d8902b356d8bf6690c9bc01e58399f80fbdfeaf9"
    },
    {
      "id": "edf7e6c9aed4cc2c2ea162df2fcf568b512bc53da08f54f8ed78b941b443b992",
      "text": "prefix cache",
      "hash": "2cdfb6c2d97e750050af7ef5f0ed3c788737a1776e6c1f740f856462592ba13a"
    },
    {
      "id": "afe7669cdf3363c6f1120d59e053cfd1dd4ef610bd1051196719b447830a6257",
      "text": "— which is part of why harnesses keep it fixed for a whole session rather than editing it as they go.",
      "hash": "332c0df290c1001d5fc0fa82a60a1e33e528ac9cc883c25facb0e5184f125ec4"
    },
    {
      "id": "efeab80f2b439d6e0e522cfc962e900a805a1b9c4a37b53ca63c9a75296c17d4",
      "text": "Models are trained to prioritise the system prompt over user messages. So when an agent insists on a convention you never asked for, or formats output in a way you can't shake, it's usually obeying its system prompt — and your message is losing the argument. Some harnesses are customisable: they give you full access to the system prompt, so you can read what the agent is actually being told and change it.",
      "hash": "47bba831f4f47d717e01d15f31e678fd194f0227864f29ffeaff0d664fc00061"
    },
    {
      "id": "eefb73ceaf9a7c3fb65ff330538c287a2bd6d35fff4c65f82f96d5463ac470f7",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7e40586f4d3267f97df8f388b954cc7ed7c8fb17ae4f6ea3347c2e7fbb98f80",
      "text": "\"Two harnesses, same model, totally different behavior on the same prompt.\"",
      "hash": "d208949603e32defe3dae15636e4b1b7f9d3210dc55c38f23780f6ee18d2ab91"
    },
    {
      "id": "abd4cf4c669a4ce184cbf95acd2f599c434559767cf3da4fd41fc0cc59582d0e",
      "text": "\"Different system prompts. One's tuned for terse code edits, the other for explaining — that's where the divergence lives, before your message even arrives.\"",
      "hash": "ac51bad67630d795c33ab2f374bc936281052ff26b37a6d09900feaa9ef8d302"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9d969aea14521f948e7fe9b402338c31109f115dfad733fe101cc0520548b4d",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2438eecbb77b5210036efb14a18959c0e05c39068be0996dacad24f6549c14d",
      "text": "Agent",
      "hash": "11b39c93777e8f1f3983bdba7c72b22fe68cfea20c677e9de53e17cb7dbfb19f"
    },
    {
      "id": "76340b94efa369241e24da98a926f55e1a05bfaa195c1caffdeb38c6b56f5082",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "35350cf084e2858b393dfe03b4f5d0db10911633e49b1d0770a5cca482d8848e",
      "text": "Session",
      "hash": "6959b4159575d8dd76d9f3bbe2c6437904f861e7860c35abd18deffb1c3425a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc8f3818c473a5a40c3bccd153c269f3d02d5414c7109dd391ab499bdcc8a096",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
